{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9c2bcd21-169f-43d3-99d9-4a3d67cca26d",
    "name": "EKT Assistant — Local API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "All 18 business/health operations plus attachment-message example and API schema. No environment file needed: collection variables capture tokens and IDs automatically. Start with Create session. Select your own file for Upload. Cart confirmation modifies synthetic demo inventory; send it only after reviewing the proposal. Use individual requests/folders rather than blindly running the whole collection. Message/confirmation retry keys persist until their payload changes. SSE emits snapshots, not token deltas. Local API defaults to http://localhost:8000. Account/history folder supports registration, login, owned conversations and logout; configure username/password variables locally. Do not export populated credentials."
  },
